type: software
title: "CMMNS"
abstract: "CMMNS (formerly Daylight Commons, and Radar before that) is a browser extension that shows where social media replies come from, signs of coordination, how replies argue, and whether a fact-checker has reviewed the claim. Install it in Chrome, Edge, Brave or Firefox."
